    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can use your mastery of <b>Sith Alchemy</b> to create mutated abominations. You must have access to a willing (or unconscious) creature to which you will apply the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sith_Abomination_Template\" title=\"Sith Abomination Template\">Sith Abomination Template</a> or the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Chrysalis_Beast_Template\" title=\"Chrysalis Beast Template\">Chrysalis Beast Template</a>. You also need a medical lab outfitted for the process, which requires a number of days equal to creature's modified CL. You must spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> at the completion of the process to complete the transformation. A creature you have mutated is considered to be a domesticated creature, but for you only (unless it was already a domesticated creature before its mutation).",
